  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<section class=\"bg-slate-900 min-h-[750px] flex items-center justify-center text-white relative overflow-hidden border-b-4 border-[#0ea5e9]\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png')]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-slate-950/90 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10 pt-24\">\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-600 text-sky-400 text-[11px] font-black px-4 py-2 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\"></div>\n            Live Dispatch Active: Vadodara &#038; All Gujarat Zones\n        </div>\n        \n        <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tighter uppercase text-white drop-shadow-2xl\">\n            Vadodara&#8217;s Premier <br> \n            <span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-blue-600\">AC Repair, Service &#038; Installation</span>\n        </h1>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl mb-10 text-slate-300 max-w-4xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n            Stop waiting for amateur mechanics. From emergency residential split AC gas charging in Alkapuri to heavy-tonnage Industrial Chiller overhauls in Makarpura GIDC, Atlas Aircon delivers military-grade climate control. We fix the complex inverter PCB faults and commercial VRF systems that standard technicians simply cannot handle.\n        </p>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-5\">\n            <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141?text=EMERGENCY:%20I%20need%20rapid%20AC%20Repair%20in%20Vadodara.\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp Dispatch\" class=\"bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1da851] text-slate-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center transition shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(37,211,102,0.4)] transform hover:-translate-y-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                <i class=\"fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-3xl mr-3\"></i> Request Emergency Dispatch\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#deep-services\" class=\"bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center transition shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-microchip text-sky-400 mr-3\"></i> View Engineering Specs\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 py-6\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-between items-center gap-6 text-center md:text-left\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-hammer text-2xl text-green-500\"></i> 20+ Years Field Experience\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-microchip text-2xl text-sky-500\"></i> Advanced PCB Diagnostics\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-box-open text-2xl text-amber-500\"></i> 100% Genuine OEM Spares\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-stopwatch text-2xl text-red-500\"></i> 90-Min Urban Response\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section id=\"deep-services\" class=\"py-24 bg-slate-50\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <span class=\"text-sky-600 font-black tracking-widest text-sm uppercase mb-3 block\">Comprehensive Capabilities</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black mb-6 text-slate-900 uppercase\">Advanced Climate Architecture in Vadodara</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed text-lg\">\n                Atlas Aircon is not a standard aggregator service. We are a dedicated team of HVAC engineers specializing in the total lifecycle management of cooling equipment. Whether you are dealing with a sudden compressor failure in the peak of Gujarat&#8217;s summer, or you require a massive multi-floor VRF installation for a new corporate office, our technical parameters far exceed local standards. Read below to understand how our engineering protocols differ from standard mechanics.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-sky-500 transition-all duration-300\">\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-sky-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600 text-3xl mb-6\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-tools\"></i></div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-slate-900 uppercase\">AC Repair &#038; Power Jet Servicing</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    A typical AC service in Vadodara involves a brush and a bucket of water. This leaves 70% of the hardened bio-slime inside your evaporator coils, restricting airflow and spiking your electricity bill. Atlas Aircon utilizes a <strong>120-Bar Power Jet Descaling System</strong> combined with non-corrosive alkaline chemicals to completely strip the aluminum fins of dirt, restoring factory-level heat exchange.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    When it comes to complex AC repair in Vadodara, we lead the industry. Modern split air conditioners rely heavily on Inverter technology. When your AC flashes an error code, local mechanics often demand you buy a brand new, expensive PCB. Our engineers perform <strong>on-site micro-soldering and IC chip replacement</strong>, saving you thousands of rupees. We also handle precision gas charging (R32, R410a, R22) utilizing dual-stage vacuum pumps to ensure zero atmospheric moisture corrupts the compressor oil.\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Inverter PCB Component-Level Repair</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Vacuum-Assisted Gas Charging by Weight</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Compressor Seize Recovery &#038; Replacement</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Copper Coil Brazing &#038; Leak Elimination</span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-sky-500 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 bg-sky-600 text-white text-[10px] font-black px-4 py-2 rounded-bl-xl uppercase tracking-widest\">Highest ROI</div>\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-sky-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600 text-3xl mb-6\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-ruler-combined\"></i></div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-slate-900 uppercase\">Precision AC Installation &#038; Shifting</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    Over 80% of premature air conditioner failures are caused by improper initial AC installation. Poor flaring of the copper pipes leads to micro-leaks, meaning your gas slowly drains out over the first year. Atlas Aircon engineers employ heavy-duty eccentric flaring tools and torque wrenches to ensure a mathematically perfect seal on every single joint during your AC installation in Vadodara.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    For commercial spaces, premium showrooms, and high-end residential apartments, we offer comprehensive <strong>Concealed Copper Piping Routing</strong>. We use industrial diamond-core cutting machines to drill perfectly round holes through concrete walls, eliminating the ugly damage caused by standard hammers and chisels. Before releasing the gas, we pressure-test the entire pipeline with dry nitrogen at 350 PSI to guarantee absolute integrity. If you are moving homes, our safe uninstallation and shifting service ensures your compressor gas is securely pumped down.\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Diamond Core Cutting (Zero Wall Damage)</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Dry Nitrogen Pressure Testing at 350 PSI</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Safe Gas Pump-Down &#038; Equipment Shifting</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Cassette, Tower, and Ductable AC Mounting</span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-sky-500 transition-all duration-300\">\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-sky-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600 text-3xl mb-6\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-industry\"></i></div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-slate-900 uppercase\">Heavy Industrial &#038; Commercial HVAC</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    When a heavy-tonnage chiller plant or a multi-zone VRF system fails in a manufacturing facility, the financial losses from halted production lines are catastrophic. Atlas Aircon provides rapid-deployment industrial AC service in Vadodara for heavy manufacturing sectors. We understand the critical nature of PLC panel cooling and industrial process chillers.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                    Our industrial engineers handle the chemical descaling of water-cooled condenser tubes, rebuilding of semi-hermetic scroll and screw compressors, and the replacement of heavy-duty 3-phase electrical contactors. For corporate clients, we offer comprehensive <strong>Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC)</strong>. Our AMC protocols include predictive maintenance using thermal imaging and vibration analysis, identifying potential catastrophic faults before they cause system-wide downtime. \n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Water-Cooled &#038; Air-Cooled Chiller Overhaul</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>VRF / VRV System Digital Diagnostics</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>CNC Machine &#038; Control Panel AC Repair</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i> <span>Corporate &#038; Industrial AMC Contracts</span></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-20 bg-white border-y border-slate-200\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <span class=\"text-sky-600 font-black tracking-widest text-sm uppercase mb-3 block\"><i class=\"fas fa-crosshairs mr-2\"></i> Local Deployment</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase mb-6\">Dedicated Service Sectors in Vadodara</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n                Air conditioning challenges vary wildly depending on your location in Vadodara. The airborne industrial dust in Makarpura requires entirely different maintenance protocols than the hard-water scaling issues found in residential Gotri. Atlas Aircon has divided the city into rapid-response tactical zones.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-sky-600 border-b-2 border-sky-100 pb-2 mb-4 uppercase\">Urban Residential Hubs</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    <strong>Alkapuri, OP Road, Gotri, and Akota:</strong> In these premium sectors, aesthetics and quiet operation are paramount. We specialize in stealth installations of Inverter Split ACs, false-ceiling Cassette units, and multi-split systems. We use heavy drop-cloths and shoe covers to ensure your luxury interiors remain spotless during the 120-bar power jet washing process.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                    <strong>Sama-Savli, Fatehgunj, Karelibaug, and Waghodia Road:</strong> High-density housing in these zones often suffers from severe voltage fluctuations. Our most common dispatches here involve blown capacitors and burnt indoor unit PCBs. Our engineers carry fully stocked mobile diagnostic kits to repair circuit boards on-site in these sectors, restoring cooling within hours.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b-2 border-slate-200 pb-2 mb-4 uppercase\">Heavy Industrial &#038; GIDC Belts</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                    <strong>Makarpura GIDC &#038; Por GIDC:</strong> The heavy metallic dust and corrosive chemical fumes in these zones choke standard condenser coils in weeks. We deploy specialized non-acidic industrial foaming agents to dissolve sludge from Panel ACs and heavy-tonnage Chiller Plants without eating away the copper tubing.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                    <strong>Manjusar, Savli, and Nandesari:</strong> These massive manufacturing belts require constant climate control for raw material processing. Our industrial squad handles everything from replacing massive 3-phase blower motors to executing nitrogen-purged copper brazing on heavy commercial ductable units. We guarantee maximum uptime for your factory floor.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white border-y border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png')]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <span class=\"text-sky-400 font-black tracking-widest text-sm uppercase mb-3 block\"><i class=\"fas fa-map-marked-alt mr-2\"></i> Expanded Coverage Map</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase mb-6\">Gujarat HVAC Engineering Network</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed\">\n                While our main command center operates in Vadodara, Atlas Aircon deploys specialized engineering squads across the entire state of Gujarat. Whether you need a residential gas charge or an industrial chiller plant overhaul, select your city below to request immediate local service.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Vadodara</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">HQ &#038; Operations</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-anand\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Anand</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-ahmedabad\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Ahmedabad</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Surat</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Rajkot</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-bharuch\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Bharuch</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-morbi\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Morbi</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">Industrial HVAC</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-kheda\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Kheda</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-godhra\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Godhra</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-daman\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Daman</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"/ac-repair-valsad\" class=\"bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-xl text-center hover:border-sky-500 hover:bg-slate-700 transition group shadow-lg\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-black text-white group-hover:text-sky-400 transition uppercase tracking-wide\">Valsad</h4>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-2 block\">AC Repair &#038; Service</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-b border-slate-200\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl\">\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-10 -top-10 text-9xl text-slate-100 opacity-50\"><i class=\"fas fa-quote-right\"></i></div>\n            <div class=\"w-40 h-40 bg-sky-100 rounded-full border-4 border-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 z-10 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(14,165,233,0.1)]\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-user-tie text-6xl text-sky-600\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center md:text-left z-10\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2\">Mehfuz Shahid Khan</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sky-600 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">Director &#038; Lead HVAC Architect</p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium mb-4 text-lg\">\n                    &#8220;For over two decades, Atlas Aircon has protected Vadodara&#8217;s homes and heavy industries from catastrophic thermal failures. The HVAC industry is plagued by untrained mechanics who &#8216;top-up&#8217; gas without fixing the leak, or bypass essential safety sensors. We operate differently. We are an engineering firm.&#8221;\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                    &#8220;Every technician on the Atlas team is strictly vetted, highly trained, and armed with the best digital manifold gauges, vacuum pumps, and multimeters in the state. We don&#8217;t guess. We diagnose, we isolate the fault, and we engineer a permanent solution.&#8221;\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 bg-slate-50\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n            <span class=\"text-sky-600 font-black tracking-widest text-sm uppercase mb-3 block\">Engineering Knowledge Base</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase\">Frequently Asked Technical Questions</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-600 font-medium mt-4 text-lg\">Understanding the mechanics of your cooling system can save you thousands in unnecessary repairs and replacements.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-sky-500 mr-2\"></i> Why is my AC running but not blowing cold air?</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    This is the most common emergency call we receive. If the indoor blower is running but the air is warm, it usually points to three faults: First, a blown start capacitor in the outdoor unit, meaning the heavy compressor cannot ignite. Second, a severe refrigerant gas leak (usually caused by a rusted U-bend in the condenser coil). Third, a choked capillary tube or expansion valve. Do not keep the AC running in this state, as it can cause the compressor to permanently seize. Disconnect the power and call Atlas Aircon for immediate AC repair in Vadodara.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-sky-500 mr-2\"></i> What is the difference between R32, R410a, and R22 gas?</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    Refrigerants are not interchangeable. Older ACs use R22 (Freon), which is heavily ozone-depleting and is currently being phased out globally, making it very expensive to refill. R410a is a blended synthetic gas used in early Inverter ACs; it requires charging strictly in a liquid state. R32 is the modern standard—it is highly efficient, has a low Global Warming Potential (GWP), but operates at extremely high pressures and is mildly flammable. Atlas engineers strictly use digital weighing scales to charge R32 to the exact gram specified by the manufacturer.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-sky-500 mr-2\"></i> Why does my Inverter AC PCB keep failing?</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    Unlike standard ACs that just turn on and off, Inverter ACs use a complex Printed Circuit Board (PCB) to convert AC power to DC, allowing the compressor to run at variable speeds. Because the electrical grid in Gujarat often experiences sudden voltage spikes, the sensitive microprocessors, IPM modules, and communication ICs on these boards can fry. While company authorized centers will force you to buy a Rs. 8,000 replacement board, Atlas Aircon has the specialized diagnostic tools to repair the burnt components on your existing circuit board at a fraction of the cost.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-sky-500 mr-2\"></i> Why is vacuuming necessary before gas charging?</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    This is the #1 difference between a professional engineer and a cheap local mechanic. Atmospheric air contains moisture. If a mechanic just hooks up a gas cylinder and forces gas into an empty AC, that moisture reacts with the synthetic compressor oil to create hydrofluoric acid. This acid literally eats your compressor from the inside out, destroying it within a year. At Atlas Aircon, we attach a heavy-duty dual-stage vacuum pump for 30 to 45 minutes to boil off all internal moisture and create a pure vacuum before injecting a single drop of new refrigerant during any AC service.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-question-circle text-sky-500 mr-2\"></i> How often should a commercial Chiller or VRF system be serviced?</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-700 text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    Heavy industrial chillers and commercial VRF (Variable Refrigerant Flow) systems in GIDC areas should undergo mandatory preventative maintenance every 30 to 45 days. Dust accumulation on the massive outdoor heat exchangers exponentially increases the electrical load on the scroll compressors. Furthermore, water-cooled chillers require chemical descaling of their condenser tubes at least twice a year to prevent calcium buildup, which acts as an insulator and destroys cooling efficiency. Our Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC) handle this scheduling automatically.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl\">\n        <div class=\"text-center mb-10\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase\">Live Engineering Logs in Vadodara</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-600 font-medium mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg\">Do not trust aggregators who hide their work. Below are real-time, verified dispatches executed by our team right here in the local area.</p>\n        </div>\n            <style>\r\n        .atlas-omni-hub { background: #0f172a; border-radius: 16px; padding: 35px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 40px 0; }\r\n        .atlas-omni-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 2px solid #334155; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\r\n        .atlas-omni-title { color: #f8fafc; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }\r\n        .atlas-omni-pulse { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #22c55e; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }\r\n        .pulse-ring { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; animation: atlas-radar-ping 2s infinite; }\r\n        .atlas-job-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; }\r\n        .atlas-job-card { background: #1e293b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; transition: 0.3s; }\r\n        .atlas-job-card:hover { border-color: #0ea5e9; transform: translateY(-5px); }\r\n        .atlas-job-card h4 { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.4; }\r\n        .atlas-job-card p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\r\n        @keyframes atlas-radar-ping { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 197, 94, 0); } }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"atlas-omni-hub\">\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-omni-header\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"atlas-omni-title\"><i class=\"fas fa-network-wired text-sky-500\"></i> Live Engineering Grid: Vadodara</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"atlas-omni-pulse\"><div class=\"pulse-ring\"></div> Live Operations</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n                    <div class=\"atlas-job-grid\">\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.atlasaircons.com/hvac-work/inverter-ac-pcb-repair-gas-charge-in-sayajigunj-vadodara/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atlas-job-card\">\r\n                            <h4>Inverter AC PCB Repair &amp; Gas Charge in Sayajigunj, Vadodara</h4>\r\n                            <p><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500\"></i> Service successfully executed and verified by Atlas dispatch.</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.atlasaircons.com/hvac-work/commercial-dispatch-3-ton-cassette-ac-repair-power-jet-wash-in-alkapuri-vadodara/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atlas-job-card\">\r\n                            <h4>Commercial Dispatch: 3-Ton Cassette AC Repair &amp; Power Jet Wash in Alkapuri, Vadodara</h4>\r\n                            <p><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500\"></i> Service successfully executed and verified by Atlas dispatch.</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.atlasaircons.com/hvac-work/emergency-dispatch-inverter-ac-pcb-circuit-repair-in-ajwa-road-vadodara/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atlas-job-card\">\r\n                            <h4>Emergency Dispatch: Inverter AC PCB Circuit Repair in Ajwa Road, Vadodara</h4>\r\n                            <p><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500\"></i> Service successfully executed and verified by Atlas dispatch.</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.atlasaircons.com/hvac-work/commercial-ac-repair-in-fatehgunj-vadodara-21-unit-overhaul/\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"atlas-job-card\">\r\n                            <h4>Commercial AC Repair in Fatehgunj, Vadodara | 21-Unit Overhaul</h4>\r\n                            <p><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500\"></i> Service successfully executed and verified by Atlas dispatch.</p>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n    \n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png')]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10\">\n        \n        <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n            <span class=\"text-sky-400 font-bold tracking-widest text-xs uppercase mb-3 block\"><i class=\"fas fa-satellite-dish mr-2\"></i> Client Terminal</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-4 uppercase\">Interactive Diagnostics</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed\">Use our proprietary engineering calculators to identify system faults before you call a technician, or calculate the financial loss of an aging chiller plant to justify a replacement to your board of directors.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-800/50 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-6 uppercase border-b border-slate-700 pb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-robot text-sky-400\"></i> Fault Diagnostic Tool</h3>\n                \r\n    <div class=\"atlas-diag-box\">\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-diag-header\"><h3><i class=\"fas fa-microchip\"></i> AI Diagnostic</h3><p>Select your system symptom.</p></div>\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-diag-grid\" id=\"diag-options\">\r\n            <button class=\"atlas-diag-btn\" onclick=\"runDiag('Blowing Warm Air','Probable refrigerant leak. Immediate pressure test required.')\"><i class=\"fas fa-temperature-high\"></i> Warm Air</button>\r\n            <button class=\"atlas-diag-btn\" onclick=\"runDiag('Water Leaking','Drain failure. High risk of structural damage.')\"><i class=\"fas fa-tint\"></i> Leaking</button>\r\n            <button class=\"atlas-diag-btn\" onclick=\"runDiag('Strange Noise','Mechanical friction. Overhaul needed.')\"><i class=\"fas fa-volume-up\"></i> Noises</button>\r\n            <button class=\"atlas-diag-btn\" onclick=\"runDiag('Power Tripping','PCB short-circuit. Fire hazard. Keep powered off.')\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i> Tripping</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"diag-result\" style=\"display:none; text-align:center; padding:20px;\">\r\n            <h4 style=\"color:#ef4444; margin-bottom:10px;\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle\"></i> Critical Fault</h4>\r\n            <p id=\"diag-msg\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px; font-weight:bold;\"></p>\r\n            <a href=\"#\" id=\"diag-wa\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"atlas-diag-cta\"><i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i> Request Dispatch to your area</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <script>function runDiag(issue, msg) { document.getElementById(\"diag-options\").style.display=\"none\"; let r=document.getElementById(\"diag-result\"); r.style.display=\"block\"; document.getElementById(\"diag-msg\").innerText=msg; document.getElementById(\"diag-wa\").href=`https://wa.me/919727257141?text=Diagnostic: ${issue} in your area. Need engineer.`; }</script>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-slate-800/50 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white mb-6 uppercase border-b border-slate-700 pb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-amber-400\"></i> Industrial Power Calculator</h3>\n                \r\n    <div class=\"atlas-roi-wrapper\">\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-roi-header\"><h3>⚡ Industrial Power Waste Calculator</h3><p>Calculate money lost due to degraded chiller efficiency.</p></div>\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-roi-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"atlas-input-group\"><label>Capacity (TR)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"roi-tr\" value=\"100\" oninput=\"calcROI()\"></div>\r\n            <div class=\"atlas-input-group\"><label>Age (Years)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"roi-age\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"calcROI()\"></div>\r\n            <div class=\"atlas-input-group\"><label>Daily Hours</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"roi-hours\" value=\"16\" oninput=\"calcROI()\"></div>\r\n            <div class=\"atlas-input-group\"><label>Rate (₹/kWh)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"roi-rate\" value=\"8\" oninput=\"calcROI()\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"atlas-roi-results\"><h4>Annual Financial Leak</h4><div class=\"waste-amount\">₹<span id=\"roi-waste\">0</span></div></div>\r\n        <button class=\"atlas-roi-btn\" onclick=\"sendROIChat()\"><i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i> Stop The Bleeding - Chat with Director</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <script>\r\n        function calcROI() { let tr=parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"roi-tr\").value)||0, a=parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"roi-age\").value)||0, h=parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"roi-hours\").value)||0, r=parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"roi-rate\").value)||0, eff=(0.65+(a*0.025))-0.70, waste=eff>0?eff*tr*h*300*r:0; document.getElementById(\"roi-waste\").innerText=Math.round(waste).toLocaleString(\"en-IN\"); }\r\n        function sendROIChat() { let w=document.getElementById(\"roi-waste\").innerText; window.open(`https://wa.me/919727257141?text=*URGENT ROI INQUIRY*%0AEstimated Loss: ₹${w} / Year. We need an overhaul.`, \"_blank\"); }\r\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", calcROI);\r\n    </script>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>\n",
